# Reflaxe.OCaml package parameters.
#
# This mirrors the files generated by `haxelib run reflaxe new`, while keeping
# `ocaml_output` as the established public output define for compatibility.

-D ocaml
-D retain-untyped-meta
--macro nullSafety("reflaxe.ocaml")
--macro reflaxe.ocaml.CompilerInit.Start()
